   BBaassiicc ddiissppllaayy mmooddeess
       --mm     Dump  PCI  device data in a backward-compatible machine readable
              form.  See below for details.

       --mmmm    Dump PCI device data in a machine readable form for easy parsing
              by scripts.  See below for details.

       --tt     Show  a tree-like diagram containing all buses, bridges, devices
